"mt_QtIAWOcoQT":{"intro":"Let's peek inside a volcano! 🌋🔍","items":[{"t":"match","q":"Match each part of a volcano to what it is.","pairs":[["magma chamber","pool of melted rock underground"],["vent","opening where magma escapes"],["crater","bowl-shaped hole at the top"]]},{"t":"pick","q":"What is the difference between magma and lava?","opts":["Magma is underground; lava is on the surface","Lava is underground","They are different rocks"],"why":"Same melted rock, different place."},{"t":"order","q":"Put the eruption steps in order.","steps":["Magma collects in the chamber","Pressure builds up","Magma rises through the vent","Lava pours out of the crater"]},{"t":"tf","q":"Magma that reaches the surface is called lava.","a":true,"why":"It gets a new name above ground."},{"t":"sort","q":"Magma or lava?","bins":["Magma","Lava"],"items":[["melted rock in the chamber",0],["glowing rock flowing down a hillside",1],["melted rock rising underground",0],["a red river cooling into black rock",1]],"why":"Underground = magma; surface = lava."}]},
